    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 13th level, you can use your action and spend 2 fel point to wreathe your body in pain and end one effect on yourself that is causing you to be charmed, frightened, or poisoned. Each creature within 5 feet of you when you use this feature must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 1d10 + half your demon hunter level in fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</p>",
